+    /**
+     * Clear a single key from the database. In addition to clearing the key from the underlying
+     * transaction, this removes any uncommitted versionstamp mutation (see
+     * {@link #addVersionMutation(MutationType, byte[], byte[])}) and any
+     * {@linkplain #addToLocalVersionCache(byte[], int) local version} associated with the given key.
+     * This ensures that if a key is cleared after an incomplete versionstamp operation has been
+     * registered against it (for example, because a record with an incomplete version is being
+     * deleted), the stale mutation is not flushed to the database when the transaction is committed.
+     *
+     * @param key the key to clear
