+     * transaction, this removes any uncommitted versionstamp mutations (see
+     * {@link #addVersionMutation(MutationType, byte[], byte[])}) and any
+     * {@linkplain #addToLocalVersionCache(byte[], int) local versions} associated with keys within the
+     * given range. This ensures that if a range is cleared after incomplete versionstamp operations have
+     * been registered against keys in that range (for example, because records with incomplete versions
+     * are being deleted in bulk), the stale mutations are not flushed to the database when the
+     * transaction is committed.
+     *
+     * @param range the range of keys to clear
